IMPORT `nii-schedule-a1-ages`

-- ===========================================================================
-- Tests: Schedule A1 (Parts A, B, C, E), s 1 "גיל הפרישה", and the day an age is reached. Row IL-33.
--
-- The table assertions are GENERATED from the printed rows of the Schedule, read from the deposited source
-- lines (4376-4382, 4390-4396, 4406-4412, 4422-4428, 4463-4475) by a parser that does not share the
-- encoder's transcription of them: for each band, its first and its last month of birth (an open band: a
-- month well inside it), and for the first band a month well before it. An age is in months: years x 12
-- plus the months printed ("65 ו־4 חודשים" is 784). A failing assertion would be a finding.
-- ===========================================================================

